This project downloads and serves the following third-party software. It is
not stored in this repository; scripts/fetch-console.sh downloads it and
verifies the SHA-256 checksums below.

OpenZiti Admin Console (ZAC)
  Source:    https://github.com/openziti/ziti-console
  menu/zac/ (local sandbox):
             4.8.0, release app-ziti-console-v4.8.0, unmodified ziti-console.zip,
             sha256 359f65466ffea40fd1ec58a502323b5e045d266d586ff14c099f01d3fd681a72
  infrastructure/console/ (routable deployment):
             MODIFIED build of 4.8.1 from https://github.com/moscait/ziti-console
             (branch main, commit 35f72f9), which adds
             an "Access Canvas" view (a drag-and-drop access designer with a
             "Set up a service" wizard; its layout is kept in the browser).
             Built with scripts/build-console.sh and published as the release
             asset console-4.8.1-access-canvas-35f72f9 of this repository,
             sha256 0e640a8433c79f206c4e2d503947b4a1978ef12cd9818681ae6f19315b914bac
             (see BUILD-INFO.txt in the archive). To use the stock release instead,
             build it with scripts/build-console.sh from the upstream repository.
  License:   Apache License, Version 2.0 (see the LICENSE file)
  Copyright NetFoundry Inc.

  Licenses for the console's own dependencies are listed in
  3rdpartylicenses.txt inside each console archive.

